    "ruleType": "unit-ability",
    "group": "Shas'o R'alai",
    "summary": "Up to twice per battle, while this unit acts as an Observer unit, you may have ranged attacks by models in its Guided unit that target its Spotted unit re-roll Wound rolls of 1 until the phase ends.\n\nTrack uses by placing 2 Blacklight Marker Drone tokens by this model and removing 1 each time this ability is used.",
